==Details==
===Event Period===
*2025-01-02 10:00 (UTC+8) to 2025-01-23 09:59 (Server Time)

===Summary===
*The following [[Resonators]] will receive an increase in drop rate during the event:
** 5-star Resonator: [[Carlotta]]
** 4-star Resonators: [[Chixia]], [[Sanhua]], [[Mortefi]]

===Notes===
* During the event, you can only obtain [[Carlotta]] in "[[When Silence Tolls/2025-01-02|When Silence Tolls]]". The above Resonator can't be obtained after the event ends.
* During the event, you can use "[[Afterglow Coral]]" to redeem [[Carlotta's Waveband]] in [[Store]] - [[Item Exchange]].
* During the event, you can try the above Resonator in "[[Ascendant Aces/2025-01-02|Ascendant Aces]]" and win rewards.

